the Google Cloud Launcher.

00:26:41.480 --> 00:26:44.480
Users can also embed the
Qualys Cloud agents directly

00:26:44.480 --> 00:26:48.050
into their GCE images for a
continuous view on security

00:26:48.050 --> 00:26:51.350
and compliance events.

00:26:51.350 --> 00:26:53.730
Another partner that I'm
excited to talk about is Brinqa.

00:26:53.730 --> 00:26:58.160
Brinqa has a cloud sale
cybersecurity risk management

00:26:58.160 --> 00:26:59.660
tool for GCP.

00:26:59.660 --> 00:27:02.750
With Brinqa, customers get
a comprehensive visibility

00:27:02.750 --> 00:27:04.729
into their cloud and
data center resources

00:27:04.729 --> 00:27:06.770
along with the ability to
measure and manage risk

00:27:06.770 --> 00:27:09.590
across several key security
concerns, like asset

00:27:09.590 --> 00:27:13.370
inventory, vulnerability
management, policy compliance,

00:27:13.370 --> 00:27:17.340
and privileged
access monitoring.

00:27:17.340 --> 00:27:19.320
The Brinqa risk
platform analyzes

00:27:19.320 --> 00:27:22.620
data from both native
GCP APIs, as well as

00:27:22.620 --> 00:27:24.990
best of breed assessment
services across the Google

00:27:24.990 --> 00:27:27.690
Cloud Platform ecosystem
which can give you complete

00:27:27.690 --> 00:27:30.720
visibility, insight, and
command over cybersecurity

00:27:30.720 --> 00:27:34.600
and it's going to be available
in Cloud Launcher very soon.

00:27:34.600 --> 00:27:37.502
And then finally, MetricStream
has an IT GRC solution

00:27:37.502 --> 00:27:39.210
which provides customers
with a great end

00:27:39.210 --> 00:27:41.280
to end solution that
enables them to scope,

00:27:41.280 --> 00:27:44.130
plan, and achieve cloud
asset security, transparency,

00:27:44.130 --> 00:27:46.110
governance, and compliance.

00:27:46.110 --> 00:27:47.960
So as customers
expand in the cloud,

00:27:47.960 --> 00:27:50.806
particularly with multi cloud
and hybrid cloud deployments,

00:27:50.806 --> 00:27:52.680
partners like these are
invaluable to helping

00:27:52.680 --> 00:27:56.000
to maintain operational
governance over your technology

00:27:56.000 --> 00:27:57.840
portfolio.

00:27:57.840 --> 00:28:00.510
I'd like now to introduce
