Six years later,
fast forward to now,

00:28:48.550 --> 00:28:52.150
Dome9 Security is
protecting some

00:28:52.150 --> 00:28:55.570
of the largest and most
complex cloud environments

00:28:55.570 --> 00:28:58.810
