00:29:10.700 --> 00:29:13.850
So what does it bring to you?

00:29:13.850 --> 00:29:17.730
And I would like to
start with some question.

00:29:17.730 --> 00:29:22.040
How many of you are familiar
with this unicorn piglet?

00:29:24.720 --> 00:29:29.760
Well, not too many, but
this toy it's called

00:29:29.760 --> 00:29:33.510
Cloud Pets is a
cloud enabled toy

00:29:33.510 --> 00:29:38.130
which allows kids to talk
with their family members.

00:29:38.130 --> 00:29:42.930
It was announced last week
that the company, Spiral Toys,

00:29:42.930 --> 00:29:48.090
had leaked over 2 million
of audio recordings of kids

00:29:48.090 --> 00:29:49.830
talking with their
family, together

00:29:49.830 --> 00:29:52.600
